{"id":"0nz4kIOCSqhTFSZf","meta":{"instanceId":"8443f10082278c46aa5cf3acf8ff0f70061a2c58bce76efac814b16290845177","templateCredsSetupCompleted":true},"name":"RestaurantOS – Swiggy/Zomato Rating Monitor & Weekly Dish Sentiment Report","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"c88cecf8-70b8-4fe0-a5af-f99522f7c642","name":"Sticky Note – Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-2624,-304],"parameters":{"color":2,"width":736,"height":908,"content":"## 🍛 RestaurantOS – Swiggy & Zomato Rating Monitor\n\nFor restaurant owners who sell on Swiggy and Zomato and keep finding out about a one-star review days too late.\n\n### How it works\nEvery 30 minutes (or instantly via webhook) new reviews are pulled in, deduplicated and matched against your menu. GPT-4o-mini reads each one, scores sentiment, picks out which dishes were praised or criticised, and drafts a reply in your brand voice. Critical reviews go straight to Telegram and the manager's inbox; the rest arrive as ready-to-paste reply drafts. Every review and dish mention is logged to Google Sheets.\n\nEach Monday at 9 AM a second flow compares this week with last week and emails a dish-by-dish sentiment report, with a short Telegram summary.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Create a Google Sheet with tabs **Reviews Log**, **Dish Mentions** and **Weekly Reports**, plus a **Menu** tab with a `dish_name` column.\n2. Connect Google Sheets, Gmail, Telegram and OpenAI credentials.\n3. Point **Fetch Swiggy & Zomato Reviews** at your review feed (aggregator or POS export) with header auth, or post reviews to the webhook.\n4. Fill in **Set Monitor Config** and **Set Report Config**: sheet IDs, Telegram chat ID, emails and brand voice.\n5. Run once manually with a test review, then activate."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"4bf5c14a-67fb-4f97-b218-bcb6af4b32af","name":"Sticky Note – Review Intake","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1760,-112],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":864,"height":672,"content":"## 📥 Review Intake\nReviews come in two ways: a 30-minute poll of your review feed, or pushed straight to the webhook. Both are reshaped into one format, whatever field names Swiggy or Zomato used."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e8229318-6000-4510-b0d1-b1bae0398d06","name":"Sticky Note – Dedupe & Menu Match","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-864,-32],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":992,"height":592,"content":"## 🧹 Config, Dedupe & Menu\nDrops reviews already in the log so nothing gets analysed twice, and pulls your menu so the AI maps comments to real dish names."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ec72e837-9bd7-4587-aa6e-704efd8b2bc6","name":"Sticky Note – AI Review Analysis","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[160,-48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":736,"height":608,"content":"## 🧠 AI Review Analysis\nGPT-4o-mini scores sentiment, tags issues and dishes, and drafts a reply in your brand voice. Results are joined back to the original review."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"16ae0083-13e6-45ea-9dc2-4adf18c81d27","name":"Sticky Note – Sheet Logging","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[928,-368],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":736,"height":576,"content":"## 🗂️ Sheet Logging\nOne row per review in Reviews Log, plus one row per dish mentioned. The weekly report reads from both tabs."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"34ac426b-c282-45b1-b20d-8328022c20fa","name":"Sticky Note – Alerts & Reply Drafts","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[944,256],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":928,"height":960,"content":"## 🚨 Alerts & Reply Drafts\nLow ratings or high-urgency reviews ping Telegram and email the manager. Everything else gets the suggested reply on Telegram, ready to paste into the partner app."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e7828100-b8a4-4ebc-9fe1-e7ca9fec82a1","name":"Sticky Note – Weekly Data Pull","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-2176,944],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1152,"height":752,"content":"## 📅 Weekly Data Pull\nEvery Monday morning, loads the last two weeks of logged reviews and dish mentions so this week can be compared with the one before."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"cc2db1a4-8843-4f55-9f79-af8f13c05a44","name":"Sticky Note – Weekly Insights","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-960,928],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":896,"height":752,"content":"## 📊 Weekly Insights\nWorks out platform averages, top complaints and each dish's sentiment trend, then the AI turns the numbers into a short owner-friendly summary."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0c311c7e-0cfc-4d11-93ca-ed0e7aec326b","name":"Sticky Note – Report Delivery","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-16,848],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":704,"height":896,"content":"## 📬 Report Delivery\nSends the full report by email, a short version on Telegram, and archives the week in the Weekly Reports tab."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1919cde2-ef45-4e49-bf16-9bea403afbf1","name":"Sticky Note – Credentials & Security","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[832,1392],"parameters":{"color":3,"width":480,"height":300,"content":"## 🔐 Credentials & Security\nUse OAuth2 for Gmail and Google Sheets, a bot token for Telegram and an API key for OpenAI, all stored as n8n credentials. Keep the review-feed key in Header Auth, not in the URL."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"86f08848-2f83-4a59-9973-9b9b2fabbeb0","name":"Poll Reviews Every 30 Min","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[-1680,80],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"minutes","minutesInterval":30}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"25c0f901-dfa9-4dae-90fb-f57b1b09a521","name":"Receive Reviews via Webhook","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[-1552,384],"webhookId":"583e2569-42bf-44fb-a838-361286e52554","parameters":{"path":"restaurant-reviews","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"017c7e15-4034-4f0f-a6f6-8d5695143247","name":"Fetch Swiggy & Zomato Reviews","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueRegularOutput","maxTries":3,"position":[-1440,80],"parameters":{"url":"https://YOUR-REVIEW-FEED.example.com/reviews?since=last_30_min","options":{"timeout":30000},"authentication":"genericCredentialType","genericAuthType":"httpHeaderAuth"},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":4.2,"waitBetweenTries":5000},{"id":"21b8d8ce-8767-4d7c-8bc3-3c12c3d4b5b9","name":"Normalize Review Payloads","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-1168,224],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Unifies Swiggy / Zomato payloads from the HTTP feed or the webhook\nconst pick = (o, keys) => { for (const k of keys) { if (o && o[k] !== undefined && o[k] !== null && o[k] !== '') return o[k]; } return ''; };\nconst toArr = v => Array.isArray(v) ? v : (v ? String(v).split(/,|\\|/).map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean) : []);\n\nconst raw = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  let j = item.json;\n  if (j && j.body !== undefined && j.headers !== undefined) j = j.body; // webhook envelope\n  if (Array.isArray(j)) raw.push(...j);\n  else if (j && Array.isArray(j.reviews)) raw.push(...j.reviews);\n  else if (j && Array.isArray(j.data)) raw.push(...j.data);\n  else if (j && Array.isArray(j.items)) raw.push(...j.items);\n  else if (j && typeof j === 'object' && Object.keys(j).length && !j.error) raw.push(j);\n}\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const r of raw) {\n  const text = String(pick(r, ['review_text', 'review', 'text', 'comment', 'reviewText', 'body']) || '').trim();\n  let rating = Number(pick(r, ['rating', 'stars', 'score', 'ratingValue']));\n  if (isNaN(rating) || rating > 5) rating = 0;\n  if (!rating && !text) continue;\n\n  let platform = String(pick(r, ['platform', 'source', 'channel']) || '').toLowerCase();\n  platform = platform.includes('zomato') ? 'Zomato' : platform.includes('swiggy') ? 'Swiggy'\n           : platform ? platform.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + platform.slice(1) : 'Unknown';\n\n  const dRaw = pick(r, ['review_date', 'date', 'created_at', 'createdAt', 'timestamp', 'time']);\n  const d = dRaw ? new Date(dRaw) : new Date();\n  const reviewDate = isNaN(d.getTime()) ? new Date().toISOString() : d.toISOString();\n\n  const orderItems = toArr(pick(r, ['order_items', 'items', 'dishes', 'ordered_items', 'orderItems']))\n    .map(x => typeof x === 'object' ? (x.name || x.item_name || x.dish || '') : String(x))\n    .filter(Boolean);\n  const customer = String(pick(r, ['customer_name', 'customer', 'user_name', 'userName', 'reviewer']) || 'Guest');\n\n  let id = String(pick(r, ['review_id', 'reviewId', 'id']) || '');\n  if (!id) {\n    const base = `${platform}|${reviewDate.slice(0, 16)}|${customer}|${text.slice(0, 40)}`;\n    let h = 0; for (const c of base) h = ((h << 5) - h + c.charCodeAt(0)) | 0;\n    id = Math.abs(h).toString(36);\n  }\n\n  out.push({ json: {\n    review_id: `${platform.slice(0, 3).toUpperCase()}-${id}`,\n    platform,\n    outlet: String(pick(r, ['outlet', 'outlet_name', 'restaurant', 'branch']) || ''),\n    order_id: String(pick(r, ['order_id', 'orderId']) || ''),\n    rating,\n    review_text: text,\n    customer_name: customer,\n    order_items: orderItems,\n    order_items_text: orderItems.join(', '),\n    review_date: reviewDate,\n  }});\n}\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"f88f6d34-1d4e-4078-ad37-0b98d4dce4d6","name":"Set Monitor Config","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-784,224],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"97e564fd-f321-46cd-b188-27522e4bf8da","name":"restaurant_name","type":"string","value":"Your Restaurant Name"},{"id":"9ebec842-6486-44c1-b57c-843389a0e88c","name":"brand_voice","type":"string","value":"Warm, humble, concise. Use the customer's first name. Hinglish is fine if the customer wrote in Hinglish."},{"id":"5188ade7-260c-4002-8930-da327e1ebbcd","name":"sheet_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"cfa04743-c5da-4eae-99cd-fc77614f2494","name":"menu_sheet_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_RESTAURANTOS_MENU_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"473c3e6a-caf0-4e6e-ad4c-eaf10ab658d9","name":"menu_sheet","type":"string","value":"Menu"},{"id":"caf64316-41d2-43a9-a984-a969780605a4","name":"reviews_sheet","type":"string","value":"Reviews Log"},{"id":"e0d29ac2-61fa-4930-97db-5e3f27ebc820","name":"dish_sheet","type":"string","value":"Dish Mentions"},{"id":"2fef8ab5-9a48-4af5-a21e-438b3c3962ee","name":"telegram_chat_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID"},{"id":"9e6d163e-91d5-4878-9242-059471ec2f0a","name":"escalation_email","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"},{"id":"3b9a4356-96a5-4119-93ea-b5e93fae5170","name":"critical_rating_threshold","type":"number","value":2}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"6cb07937-28ca-43f6-a3aa-aaf3d5e341a0","name":"Get Logged Reviews","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[-544,224],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.reviews_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"9d7e2289-2aab-411b-ae8c-477e2b1c9c7f","name":"Get Menu Items","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[-304,224],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.menu_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.menu_sheet_id }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"8dba8886-ebf1-4026-987f-891c81641ba3","name":"Filter New Reviews","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-64,224],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Dedupe against the log and attach the canonical menu for dish mapping\nconst s = $('Set Monitor Config').first().json;\nconst logged = new Set($('Get Logged Reviews').all().map(i => String(i.json.review_id || '')).filter(Boolean));\n\nconst menu = $('Get Menu Items').all().map(i => i.json).map(r => ({\n  dish: String(r.dish_name || r['Dish Name'] || r['Item Name'] || r.item_name || r.Item || r.name || r.Name || '').trim(),\n  category: String(r.category || r.Category || '').trim(),\n})).filter(m => m.dish);\nconst menuList = menu.length\n  ? menu.map(m => `- ${m.dish}${m.category ? ` (${m.category})` : ''}`).join('\\n')\n  : '(menu not available - use the dish names exactly as the customer wrote them)';\n\nconst keys = ['review_id','platform','outlet','order_id','rating','review_text','customer_name','order_items','order_items_text','review_date'];\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $('Set Monitor Config').all()) {\n  const r = item.json;\n  if (!r.review_id || logged.has(r.review_id) || seen.has(r.review_id)) continue;\n  seen.add(r.review_id);\n  const clean = {};\n  keys.forEach(k => clean[k] = r[k]);\n  out.push({ json: { ...clean, restaurant_name: s.restaurant_name, brand_voice: s.brand_voice, menu_list: menuList } });\n}\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"3b6033c2-f7a5-4719-bd89-14dff9f177a0","name":"AI Analyze Review & Draft Reply","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[256,224],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{"temperature":0.4},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"You are the guest-experience analyst for an Indian restaurant that sells on Swiggy and Zomato.\nAnalyse ONE customer review and return ONLY a JSON object with exactly these keys:\n{\n  \"overall_sentiment\": \"positive\" | \"neutral\" | \"negative\" | \"mixed\",\n  \"sentiment_score\": number from -1 (very negative) to 1 (very positive),\n  \"urgency\": \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\",\n  \"issue_categories\": array from [\"taste\",\"quality\",\"portion\",\"temperature\",\"packaging\",\"delivery_delay\",\"missing_item\",\"wrong_item\",\"hygiene\",\"pricing\",\"spice_level\",\"freshness\",\"staff\",\"none\"],\n  \"dish_mentions\": [ { \"dish\": string, \"sentiment\": \"positive\"|\"neutral\"|\"negative\", \"score\": number -1..1, \"aspect\": string, \"evidence\": string, \"attribution\": \"explicit\"|\"inferred\" } ],\n  \"summary\": string (max 20 words),\n  \"reply_draft\": string,\n  \"internal_action\": string\n}\n\nDISH MAPPING RULES\n- Map every dish the customer talks about to the closest name in the MENU list (handle typos, abbreviations, Hinglish, e.g. \"pnr tikka\" -> \"Paneer Tikka\").\n- If a dish is not on the menu, use \"Unmapped: <name as written>\".\n- If the review has no dish names but clearly judges the food and ordered items are given, add each ordered item with attribution \"inferred\" and the overall sentiment. Delivery/packaging-only complaints must NOT be attributed to dishes.\n- aspect = short label like taste, portion, spice, temperature, freshness, presentation, value. evidence = a short paraphrase of what the customer said (max 12 words).\n\nURGENCY\n- high: hygiene/foreign object, food poisoning, wrong or missing items, abusive experience, rating 1, or legal/social-media threat.\n- medium: rating 2-3 with a concrete fixable complaint.\n- low: everything else.\n\nREPLY RULES\n- Follow the brand voice. 40-90 words, under 450 characters, no hashtags, max one emoji.\n- Thank the customer by first name (skip the name if it is \"Guest\").\n- Positive: thank them and mention the specific dish they liked.\n- Negative/mixed: apologise for the specific issue, never argue, never blame the delivery partner by name, never promise refunds or free food, invite them to share their order ID via the app chat so the team can make it right.\n- Rating-only reviews (no text): short, genuine thank-you or \"we'd love to know how we can do better\".\n- Reply in the customer's language/register (English or Hinglish).\n- Never invent facts about the order.\n\ninternal_action: one concrete instruction for the kitchen/ops team (or \"None\" for positive reviews)."},{"content":"=Restaurant: {{ $json.restaurant_name }}\nBrand voice: {{ $json.brand_voice }}\nPlatform: {{ $json.platform }}\nRating: {{ $json.rating }}/5\nCustomer: {{ $json.customer_name }}\nOrdered items: {{ $json.order_items_text || 'not provided' }}\nReview text:\n---\n{{ $json.review_text || '(rating only, no text)' }}\n---\n\nMENU:\n{{ $json.menu_list }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"c9823bc9-bb09-4230-b847-0219e6fd113c","name":"Merge Review with AI Analysis","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[640,224],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Combine each review with its AI analysis and pre-build alert messages\nconst s = $('Set Monitor Config').first().json;\nconst threshold = Number(s.critical_rating_threshold) || 2;\nconst reviews = $('Filter New Reviews').all();\nconst esc = v => String(v ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst icon = x => x === 'positive' ? '👍' : x === 'negative' ? '👎' : '➖';\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  let a = item.json.message?.content ?? item.json.content ?? item.json.text ?? {};\n  if (typeof a === 'string') { try { a = JSON.parse(a.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim()); } catch (e) { a = {}; } }\n  const r = reviews[i] ? reviews[i].json : {};\n  const rating = Number(r.rating) || 0;\n  const dishes = Array.isArray(a.dish_mentions) ? a.dish_mentions.filter(d => d && d.dish) : [];\n  const issues = (Array.isArray(a.issue_categories) ? a.issue_categories : []).filter(x => x && x !== 'none');\n  const urgency = ['low', 'medium', 'high'].includes(a.urgency) ? a.urgency : (rating && rating <= threshold ? 'high' : 'low');\n  const isCritical = (rating > 0 && rating <= threshold) || urgency === 'high';\n  const full = Math.max(0, Math.min(5, Math.round(rating)));\n  const stars = rating ? '★'.repeat(full) + '☆'.repeat(5 - full) : 'no rating';\n  const reply = a.reply_draft || '';\n\n  const dishLine = dishes.length\n    ? dishes.map(d => `${icon(d.sentiment)} ${esc(d.dish)}${d.aspect ? ` <i>(${esc(d.aspect)})</i>` : ''}`).join('\\n')\n    : '<i>No specific dish mentioned</i>';\n  const header = isCritical\n    ? `🚨 <b>CRITICAL ${esc(r.platform)} REVIEW</b> — ${stars}`\n    : `⭐ <b>New ${esc(r.platform)} review</b> — ${stars}`;\n  const lines = [\n    header, '',\n    `<b>Customer:</b> ${esc(r.customer_name)}`,\n    r.outlet ? `<b>Outlet:</b> ${esc(r.outlet)}` : null,\n    r.order_items_text ? `<b>Ordered:</b> ${esc(r.order_items_text)}` : null,\n    `<b>Sentiment:</b> ${esc(a.overall_sentiment || 'n/a')} · <b>Issues:</b> ${esc(issues.join(', ') || 'none')}`,\n    '',\n    `<blockquote>${esc((r.review_text || '(rating only, no text)').slice(0, 700))}</blockquote>`,\n    '<b>Dish signals:</b>', dishLine, '',\n    '✍️ <b>Suggested reply</b> (tap to copy):',\n    `<code>${esc(reply)}</code>`,\n  ];\n  if (isCritical && a.internal_action) lines.push('', `⚠️ <b>Action:</b> ${esc(a.internal_action)}`);\n  lines.push('', `<i>ID: ${esc(r.review_id)}</i>`);\n\n  const email_html = `<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:620px\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#b91c1c\">🚨 Critical ${esc(r.platform)} review — ${stars}</h2>\n<p><b>Restaurant:</b> ${esc(s.restaurant_name)}${r.outlet ? ' · <b>Outlet:</b> ' + esc(r.outlet) : ''}<br>\n<b>Customer:</b> ${esc(r.customer_name)}${r.order_id ? ' · <b>Order:</b> ' + esc(r.order_id) : ''}<br>\n<b>Ordered:</b> ${esc(r.order_items_text || 'n/a')}<br><b>Issues:</b> ${esc(issues.join(', ') || 'n/a')} · <b>Urgency:</b> ${esc(urgency)}</p>\n<blockquote style=\"border-left:4px solid #ef4444;margin:0;padding:8px 12px;background:#fef2f2\">${esc(r.review_text || '(rating only)')}</blockquote>\n<h3>Recommended action</h3><p>${esc(a.internal_action || 'Review with the kitchen lead.')}</p>\n<h3>Suggested public reply</h3><p style=\"background:#f3f4f6;padding:10px;border-radius:6px\">${esc(reply)}</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:12px\">Review ID ${esc(r.review_id)} · logged in Google Sheets with status Draft</p></div>`;\n\n  return { json: {\n    ...r,\n    overall_sentiment: a.overall_sentiment || 'neutral',\n    sentiment_score: typeof a.sentiment_score === 'number' ? a.sentiment_score : 0,\n    urgency,\n    issue_categories: issues,\n    dish_mentions: dishes,\n    summary: a.summary || '',\n    reply_draft: reply,\n    internal_action: a.internal_action || '',\n    is_critical: isCritical,\n    telegram_text: lines.filter(l => l !== null).join('\\n'),\n    email_subject: `🚨 ${r.platform} ${rating}★ review needs attention — ${r.customer_name}`,\n    email_html,\n  }, pairedItem: { item: i } };\n});"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"12fbb874-2334-4645-922a-a904056f0187","name":"Build Reviews Log Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1056,-208],"parameters":{"jsCode":"return $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const r = item.json;\n  return { json: {\n    review_id: r.review_id,\n    platform: r.platform,\n    outlet: r.outlet,\n    order_id: r.order_id,\n    review_date: r.review_date,\n    logged_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    customer_name: r.customer_name,\n    rating: r.rating,\n    review_text: r.review_text,\n    order_items: r.order_items_text,\n    overall_sentiment: r.overall_sentiment,\n    sentiment_score: r.sentiment_score,\n    urgency: r.urgency,\n    issue_categories: (r.issue_categories || []).join(', '),\n    summary: r.summary,\n    reply_draft: r.reply_draft,\n    internal_action: r.internal_action,\n    reply_status: 'Draft',\n  }, pairedItem: { item: i } };\n});"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"38adda26-55be-47c9-8b5e-db59552c0adf","name":"Split Dish Mentions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1056,0],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// One row per dish mention -> powers the weekly dish-level report\nconst out = [];\n$input.all().forEach((item, i) => {\n  const r = item.json;\n  for (const d of (r.dish_mentions || [])) {\n    out.push({ json: {\n      review_id: r.review_id,\n      platform: r.platform,\n      outlet: r.outlet,\n      review_date: r.review_date,\n      rating: r.rating,\n      dish: String(d.dish).trim(),\n      sentiment: d.sentiment || 'neutral',\n      score: typeof d.score === 'number' ? d.score : 0,\n      aspect: d.aspect || '',\n      evidence: d.evidence || '',\n      attribution: d.attribution || 'explicit',\n    }, pairedItem: { item: i } });\n  }\n});\nreturn out;"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e05d1aff-4ace-4f77-8ad3-28fab7a160bc","name":"Is Critical Review?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1056,608],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"e9325933-fe37-469b-817f-3cdb0fb92375","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.is_critical }}","rightValue":true}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"b604d438-d6f8-45e0-a1e4-5c490336fa97","name":"Append to Reviews Log","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1296,-208],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.reviews_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"5ed0a6d3-0c06-4f28-9fa4-b2f15c56eb12","name":"Append to Dish Mentions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1296,0],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.dish_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"9b2c268e-6530-401b-9715-94d485a2427a","name":"Send Critical Alert to Telegram","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[1536,512],"webhookId":"eadedb14-76d9-45cc-acfe-4e2cde10fbab","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.telegram_text }}","chatId":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.telegram_chat_id }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"7d33e7b8-19fc-4850-80de-1f07af37c509","name":"Email Manager Escalation","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1488,752],"webhookId":"df0156de-4641-43ac-b2d7-2c14ab5b4a2a","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.escalation_email }}","message":"={{ $json.email_html }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"={{ $json.email_subject }}"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"af5ed579-2f33-43a1-8748-97b81a18d9ff","name":"Send Reply Draft to Telegram","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[1424,992],"webhookId":"291d4bd2-0714-4b85-a966-ba8e6de51fbc","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.telegram_text }}","chatId":"={{ $('Set Monitor Config').first().json.telegram_chat_id }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"b9f8c0c6-2f9f-4663-9d55-2639620a0f6c","name":"Every Monday 9 AM","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[-2096,1280],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"weeks","triggerAtDay":[1],"triggerAtHour":9}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"6cfa9069-7a70-4dd2-ba23-c436c942b5d4","name":"Set Report Config","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[-1856,1280],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"feccb4ef-99ed-4ccb-9d4b-5611a2ce14ba","name":"restaurant_name","type":"string","value":"Your Restaurant Name"},{"id":"ded2e2bd-910b-41c1-9483-4d4768e79443","name":"sheet_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"},{"id":"35b035fc-3a71-45f4-a284-789bf29e71d0","name":"reviews_sheet","type":"string","value":"Reviews Log"},{"id":"b9dc25ce-a342-4431-868d-3658d2871981","name":"dish_sheet","type":"string","value":"Dish Mentions"},{"id":"797c10bf-0e38-47ac-ad61-004583f5d645","name":"reports_sheet","type":"string","value":"Weekly Reports"},{"id":"17b91460-b16c-4d68-a79c-d47f1df33069","name":"telegram_chat_id","type":"string","value":"YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID"},{"id":"585cc1c3-440b-4384-94e0-83d9399d2538","name":"report_email","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"},{"id":"00f07085-de8d-4f3b-859c-07f7670e3b1a","name":"critical_rating_threshold","type":"number","value":2},{"id":"b68a3ba0-91f8-46ad-a59c-a6fe8036c302","name":"min_mentions_for_ranking","type":"number","value":2}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"3295e94a-2071-43a4-ad18-f3341fde34ae","name":"Get Reviews for Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[-1616,1280],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.reviews_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"b1ea4f6d-2805-4584-9d62-13a9b5ab02f1","name":"Get Dish Mentions for Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[-1376,1280],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.dish_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"executeOnce":true,"typeVersion":4.5,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"9beb5915-4d11-4715-8371-e25726ba1e65","name":"Aggregate Weekly Dish Sentiment","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-848,1280],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Dish-level + platform-level aggregation, this week vs previous week\nconst s = $('Set Report Config').first().json;\nconst DAY = 864e5, now = Date.now();\nconst startThis = now - 7 * DAY, startPrev = now - 14 * DAY;\nconst t = r => { const d = new Date(r.review_date || r.logged_at).getTime(); return isNaN(d) ? 0 : d; };\nconst avg = arr => arr.length ? arr.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / arr.length : null;\nconst round = (n, d = 2) => (n === null || n === undefined) ? null : Math.round(n * 10 ** d) / 10 ** d;\nconst threshold = Number(s.critical_rating_threshold) || 2;\nconst minM = Number(s.min_mentions_for_ranking) || 2;\n\nconst reviews = $('Get Reviews for Report').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.review_id);\nconst mentions = $('Get Dish Mentions for Report').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r.dish);\nconst thisWeek = reviews.filter(r => t(r) >= startThis);\nconst prevWeek = reviews.filter(r => t(r) >= startPrev && t(r) < startThis);\nconst mThis = mentions.filter(m => t(m) >= startThis);\nconst mPrev = mentions.filter(m => t(m) >= startPrev && t(m) < startThis);\n\n// Platform split\nconst ps = {};\nfor (const r of thisWeek) {\n  const p = r.platform || 'Unknown';\n  ps[p] = ps[p] || { platform: p, reviews: 0, ratings: [], negative: 0, critical: 0 };\n  ps[p].reviews++;\n  const rt = Number(r.rating); if (rt) ps[p].ratings.push(rt);\n  if (r.overall_sentiment === 'negative') ps[p].negative++;\n  if ((rt && rt <= threshold) || r.urgency === 'high') ps[p].critical++;\n}\nconst platforms = Object.values(ps).map(p => ({ platform: p.platform, reviews: p.reviews, avg_rating: round(avg(p.ratings)), negative: p.negative, critical: p.critical }));\n\n// Issue frequency\nconst ic = {};\nthisWeek.forEach(r => String(r.issue_categories || '').split(',').map(x => x.trim()).filter(x => x && x !== 'none').forEach(x => ic[x] = (ic[x] || 0) + 1));\nconst top_issues = Object.entries(ic).sort((a, b) => b[1] - a[1]).slice(0, 6).map(([issue, count]) => ({ issue, count }));\n\n// Dish aggregation\nconst byDish = list => {\n  const m = {};\n  for (const x of list) {\n    const k = String(x.dish).trim();\n    m[k] = m[k] || { dish: k, mentions: 0, positive: 0, neutral: 0, negative: 0, scores: [], aspects: {}, evidence: [] };\n    const d = m[k]; d.mentions++;\n    const sen = String(x.sentiment || 'neutral');\n    if (sen === 'positive') d.positive++; else if (sen === 'negative') d.negative++; else d.neutral++;\n    const sc = Number(x.score); if (x.score !== '' && !isNaN(sc)) d.scores.push(sc);\n    if (sen === 'negative' && x.aspect) d.aspects[x.aspect] = (d.aspects[x.aspect] || 0) + 1;\n    if (x.evidence && d.evidence.length < 3) d.evidence.push(`${sen === 'negative' ? '−' : sen === 'positive' ? '+' : '~'} ${x.evidence}`);\n  }\n  return m;\n};\nconst cur = byDish(mThis), prev = byDish(mPrev);\nconst dishes = Object.values(cur).map(d => {\n  const a = avg(d.scores), p = prev[d.dish] ? avg(prev[d.dish].scores) : null;\n  return {\n    dish: d.dish, mentions: d.mentions, positive: d.positive, neutral: d.neutral, negative: d.negative,\n    net_sentiment_pct: Math.round((d.positive - d.negative) / d.mentions * 100),\n    avg_score: round(a), prev_avg_score: round(p),\n    prev_mentions: prev[d.dish] ? prev[d.dish].mentions : 0,\n    trend: (a !== null && p !== null) ? round(a - p) : null,\n    top_complaints: Object.entries(d.aspects).sort((x, y) => y[1] - x[1]).slice(0, 3).map(([k, v]) => `${k} (${v})`).join(', '),\n    evidence: d.evidence,\n    unmapped: d.dish.toLowerCase().startsWith('unmapped'),\n  };\n}).sort((a, b) => b.mentions - a.mentions);\n\nconst mapped = dishes.filter(d => !d.unmapped);\nconst star_dishes = mapped.filter(d => d.mentions >= minM && d.net_sentiment_pct > 0)\n  .sort((a, b) => b.net_sentiment_pct - a.net_sentiment_pct || b.mentions - a.mentions).slice(0, 5);\nconst attention_dishes = mapped.filter(d => d.negative >= 2 || (d.mentions >= minM && d.net_sentiment_pct < 0) || (d.trend !== null && d.trend <= -0.3))\n  .sort((a, b) => a.net_sentiment_pct - b.net_sentiment_pct).slice(0, 5);\nconst unmapped_mentions = dishes.filter(d => d.unmapped).map(d => ({ dish: d.dish, mentions: d.mentions }));\n\nconst sentiment_distribution = { positive: 0, neutral: 0, negative: 0, mixed: 0 };\nthisWeek.forEach(r => { if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(sentiment_distribution, r.overall_sentiment)) sentiment_distribution[r.overall_sentiment]++; });\nconst rThis = thisWeek.map(r => Number(r.rating)).filter(Boolean), rPrev = prevWeek.map(r => Number(r.rating)).filter(Boolean);\n\nconst overview = {\n  restaurant: s.restaurant_name,\n  week_start: new Date(startThis).toISOString().slice(0, 10),\n  week_end: new Date(now).toISOString().slice(0, 10),\n  total_reviews: thisWeek.length, prev_total_reviews: prevWeek.length,\n  avg_rating: round(avg(rThis)), prev_avg_rating: round(avg(rPrev)),\n  critical_reviews: thisWeek.filter(r => (Number(r.rating) && Number(r.rating) <= threshold) || r.urgency === 'high').length,\n  pending_replies: thisWeek.filter(r => String(r.reply_status || 'Draft').toLowerCase() === 'draft').length,\n  dish_mentions: mThis.length,\n  sentiment_distribution, platforms, top_issues,\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  overview, dishes, star_dishes, attention_dishes, unmapped_mentions,\n  stats_for_ai: { overview, star_dishes, attention_dishes, unmapped_mentions,\n    all_dishes: dishes.slice(0, 25).map(({ evidence, unmapped, ...d }) => ({ ...d, sample_feedback: evidence })) },\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"235db9eb-4d42-4a8a-a24b-5472b1c37948","name":"AI Write Weekly Insights","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-656,1280],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O-MINI"},"options":{"temperature":0.3},"messages":{"values":[{"role":"system","content":"You are a restaurant operations consultant. You receive one week of aggregated Swiggy/Zomato review analytics (overall stats, per-platform split, top issues, and dish-level sentiment with week-over-week trend).\nReturn ONLY a JSON object:\n{\n  \"headline\": string (max 14 words, the single most important takeaway),\n  \"executive_summary\": string (3-4 sentences, plain language for the owner, cite numbers),\n  \"wins\": array of 2-4 short strings (what is working, name dishes),\n  \"concerns\": array of 2-4 short strings (what is hurting ratings, name dishes and aspects),\n  \"actions\": array of 3-5 objects { \"priority\": \"high\"|\"medium\"|\"low\", \"action\": string (specific, doable this week), \"dish\": string or \"\" },\n  \"menu_ideas\": array of 0-3 short strings (promote, fix recipe, reprice, or retire suggestions backed by the data)\n}\nRules: base everything strictly on the data; do not invent dishes or numbers. If total_reviews is 0, say there was no review activity and suggest checking the review feed connection. Mention unmapped dishes if any (they may need adding to the menu sheet)."},{"content":"=Weekly analytics JSON:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.stats_for_ai) }}"}]},"jsonOutput":true},"typeVersion":1.8},{"id":"375352d6-0e8a-4e28-ba65-dbd0bb25a50e","name":"Build Weekly Report","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-256,1280],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Turns stats + AI insights into an HTML email, Telegram summary and a history row\nconst st = $('Aggregate Weekly Dish Sentiment').first().json;\nconst o = st.overview;\nlet ins = $input.first().json.message?.content ?? $input.first().json.content ?? {};\nif (typeof ins === 'string') { try { ins = JSON.parse(ins.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim()); } catch (e) { ins = {}; } }\n\nconst esc = v => String(v ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst fmt = n => (n === null || n === undefined) ? '—' : n;\nconst delta = (a, b) => (a === null || b === null || a === undefined || b === undefined) ? ''\n  : (a - b >= 0 ? `<span style=\"color:#15803d\">▲ ${(a - b).toFixed(2)}</span>` : `<span style=\"color:#b91c1c\">▼ ${(b - a).toFixed(2)}</span>`);\nconst col = p => p >= 40 ? '#15803d' : p >= 0 ? '#a16207' : '#b91c1c';\nconst li = arr => (Array.isArray(arr) && arr.length)\n  ? '<ul>' + arr.map(x => `<li>${typeof x === 'string' ? esc(x) : `<b>[${esc((x.priority || '').toUpperCase())}]</b> ${esc(x.action)}${x.dish ? ' — <i>' + esc(x.dish) + '</i>' : ''}`}</li>`).join('') + '</ul>'\n  : '<p style=\"color:#6b7280\">None this week.</p>';\nconst td = 'style=\"padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb\"';\nconst th = 'style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:#111827;color:#fff;text-align:left\"';\n\nconst dishRows = st.dishes.filter(d => !d.unmapped).slice(0, 20).map(d => `<tr>\n<td ${td}>${esc(d.dish)}</td><td ${td} align=\"center\">${d.mentions}</td>\n<td ${td} align=\"center\">${d.positive} / ${d.neutral} / ${d.negative}</td>\n<td ${td} align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:${col(d.net_sentiment_pct)};font-weight:bold\">${d.net_sentiment_pct}%</td>\n<td ${td} align=\"center\">${d.trend === null ? 'new' : (d.trend >= 0 ? '▲ ' : '▼ ') + Math.abs(d.trend)}</td>\n<td ${td}>${esc(d.top_complaints || '—')}</td></tr>`).join('');\nconst platRows = o.platforms.map(p => `<tr><td ${td}>${esc(p.platform)}</td><td ${td} align=\"center\">${p.reviews}</td><td ${td} align=\"center\">${fmt(p.avg_rating)}</td><td ${td} align=\"center\">${p.negative}</td><td ${td} align=\"center\">${p.critical}</td></tr>`).join('');\nconst issues = o.top_issues.length ? o.top_issues.map(x => `${esc(x.issue)} (${x.count})`).join(' · ') : 'None';\nconst sd = o.sentiment_distribution;\n\nconst html = `<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:760px;color:#111827\">\n<h1 style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">🍽️ ${esc(o.restaurant)} — Weekly Review Report</h1>\n<p style=\"color:#6b7280;margin-top:0\">${o.week_start} → ${o.week_end} · Swiggy & Zomato</p>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px\"><b>${esc(ins.headline || 'Weekly summary')}</b><br>${esc(ins.executive_summary || '')}</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;margin:16px 0;text-align:center\"><tr>\n<td><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:bold\">${o.total_reviews}</div>reviews <small>(prev ${o.prev_total_reviews})</small></td>\n<td><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:bold\">${fmt(o.avg_rating)}★</div>avg rating ${delta(o.avg_rating, o.prev_avg_rating)}</td>\n<td><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:bold;color:#b91c1c\">${o.critical_reviews}</div>critical</td>\n<td><div style=\"font-size:26px;font-weight:bold\">${o.pending_replies}</div>replies pending</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Sentiment:</b> 👍 ${sd.positive} · ➖ ${sd.neutral} · 🔀 ${sd.mixed} · 👎 ${sd.negative} &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>Top issues:</b> ${issues}</p>\n<h2>Dish-level sentiment</h2>\n${dishRows ? `<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px\"><tr><th ${th}>Dish</th><th ${th}>Mentions</th><th ${th}>+ / ~ / −</th><th ${th}>Net</th><th ${th}>WoW</th><th ${th}>Top complaints</th></tr>${dishRows}</table>` : '<p style=\"color:#6b7280\">No dish mentions this week.</p>'}\n${st.unmapped_mentions.length ? `<p style=\"color:#a16207\"><b>Not on menu sheet:</b> ${st.unmapped_mentions.map(u => esc(u.dish.replace(/^Unmapped:\\s*/i, '')) + ' (' + u.mentions + ')').join(', ')}</p>` : ''}\n<h2>Platforms</h2>\n${platRows ? `<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px\"><tr><th ${th}>Platform</th><th ${th}>Reviews</th><th ${th}>Avg ★</th><th ${th}>Negative</th><th ${th}>Critical</th></tr>${platRows}</table>` : '<p style=\"color:#6b7280\">No reviews.</p>'}\n<h2>✅ Wins</h2>${li(ins.wins)}\n<h2>⚠️ Concerns</h2>${li(ins.concerns)}\n<h2>🎯 Actions this week</h2>${li(ins.actions)}\n<h2>📋 Menu ideas</h2>${li(ins.menu_ideas)}\n<p style=\"color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px\">Generated by RestaurantOS Rating Monitor · full data in Google Sheets</p></div>`;\n\nconst top = st.star_dishes[0], worst = st.attention_dishes[0];\nconst tLines = [\n  `📊 <b>${esc(o.restaurant)} — weekly reviews</b>`,\n  `<i>${o.week_start} → ${o.week_end}</i>`, '',\n  `<b>${esc(ins.headline || '')}</b>`, '',\n  `⭐ Avg rating: <b>${fmt(o.avg_rating)}</b> (prev ${fmt(o.prev_avg_rating)})`,\n  `📝 Reviews: ${o.total_reviews} · 🚨 Critical: ${o.critical_reviews} · ⏳ Pending replies: ${o.pending_replies}`,\n  top ? `🏆 Star dish: <b>${esc(top.dish)}</b> (${top.net_sentiment_pct}% net, ${top.mentions} mentions)` : null,\n  worst ? `🔧 Needs attention: <b>${esc(worst.dish)}</b> (${worst.net_sentiment_pct}% net${worst.top_complaints ? ', ' + esc(worst.top_complaints) : ''})` : null,\n  '', '<b>Top actions:</b>',\n  ...((Array.isArray(ins.actions) ? ins.actions : []).slice(0, 3).map((a, i) => `${i + 1}. ${esc(a.action)}`)),\n  '', '<i>Full report sent by email.</i>',\n].filter(l => l !== null);\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  subject: `🍽️ ${o.restaurant} weekly review report — ${fmt(o.avg_rating)}★, ${o.total_reviews} reviews (${o.week_start} → ${o.week_end})`,\n  html,\n  telegram_text: tLines.join('\\n'),\n  row: {\n    week_start: o.week_start, week_end: o.week_end, total_reviews: o.total_reviews,\n    avg_rating: o.avg_rating, prev_avg_rating: o.prev_avg_rating, critical_reviews: o.critical_reviews,\n    pending_replies: o.pending_replies, top_dish: top ? top.dish : '', attention_dish: worst ? worst.dish : '',\n    top_issue: o.top_issues[0] ? o.top_issues[0].issue : '', headline: ins.headline || '',\n    generated_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  },\n}}];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e6baa720-c225-4969-983c-3914e611df0a","name":"Email Weekly Report to Owner","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[288,1024],"webhookId":"5e6a6061-4b24-46b9-9521-e76ebbf736e0","parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.report_email }}","message":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"={{ $json.subject }}"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"6bf79dd6-4d2f-4cf9-990e-0184ae3ef793","name":"Send Weekly Summary to Telegram","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[192,1280],"webhookId":"655ef428-2f25-46b6-8ff6-37f1b49e9aa4","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.telegram_text }}","chatId":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.telegram_chat_id }}","additionalFields":{"parse_mode":"HTML","appendAttribution":false}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"e62005b3-1924-4a00-954c-da1f2106a8a8","name":"Build Weekly Report Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[128,1520],"parameters":{"jsCode":"return [{ json: $input.first().json.row }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"1a4ba66c-35c9-488d-b806-0beb62d0a9ba","name":"Append to Weekly Reports","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[352,1520],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.reports_sheet }}"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Set Report Config').first().json.sheet_id }}"}},"typeVersion":4.5}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"binaryMode":"separate","executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"ceb83740-17f3-42fd-a75d-5e464cf7b3fc","nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Get Menu Items":{"main":[[{"node":"Filter New Reviews","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every Monday 9 AM":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Report Config","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Set Report Config":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Reviews for Report","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Filter New Reviews":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Analyze Review & Draft Reply","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Logged Reviews":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Menu Items","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Set Monitor Config":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Logged Reviews","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Weekly Report":{"main":[[{"node":"Email Weekly Report to Owner","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Send Weekly Summary to Telegram","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Build Weekly Report Row","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Is Critical Review?":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Critical Alert to Telegram","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Email Manager Escalation","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Send Reply Draft to Telegram","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Split Dish Mentions":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Dish Mentions","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Reviews Log Row":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Reviews Log","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Reviews for Report":{"main":[[{"node":"Get Dish Mentions for Report","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Build Weekly Report Row":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Weekly Reports","type":"main","index":0}]]},"AI Write Weekly Insights":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Weekly Report","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Normalize Review Payloads":{"main":[[{"node":"Set Monitor Config","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Poll Reviews Every 30 Min":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Swiggy & Zomato Reviews","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Receive Reviews via Webhook":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Review Payloads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Get Dish Mentions for Report":{"main":[[{"node":"Aggregate Weekly Dish Sentiment","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Fetch Swiggy & Zomato Reviews":{"main":[[{"node":"Normalize Review Payloads","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Merge Review with AI Analysis":{"main":[[{"node":"Build Reviews Log Row","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Split Dish Mentions","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Is Critical Review?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"AI Analyze Review & Draft Reply":{"main":[[{"node":"Merge Review with AI Analysis","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Aggregate Weekly Dish Sentiment":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Write Weekly Insights","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}